<title>FRANCE: Eiffage blames low activity for results.</title>
<headline>Eiffage blames low activity for results.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Public works group Eiffage attributed its poor first-half results on Monday to a marked drop in activity in its building in roadworks divisions.</p>
<p>But it said its electrical and international services operations remained &quot;rather well oriented.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
